# Vehicle controls, a follow camera and an interactive retained canvas.
# Press Play: WASD drives, Space brakes, Shift applies the handbrake, arrows orbit.
# The controls canvas runs Assets/Scripts/CSharp/CarDemo.cs and changes follow, distance and power.
# Car owns the VehicleComponent; its mesh children provide visuals independently of the chassis.
# Tune wheels and suspension on the vehicle, and ground friction on the static surface.

Version: 5
RelativeAssetPaths: true
Scene: "Car Demo"
